questions.q:
What does the @theme directive let you do in v4?
```html
@theme {
  --color-brand: oklch(0.6 0.2 250);
}

<div class="bg-brand">
```

A theme sets --spacing: 0.5rem. What does p-4 become?
```html
@theme {
  --spacing: 0.5rem;
}

<div class="p-4">
```

How do you make dark mode class-based in v4?
```html
@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));

<div class="dark:bg-black">
```

What does @utility let you define in v4?
```html
@utility card-contain {
  contain: layout paint;
}

<div class="card-contain">
```

How can multiple brands reuse the same components?
```html
@theme {
  --color-brand: oklch(0.6 0.2 250);
}

/* each brand overrides the variable on a wrapper: [data-brand="b"] { --color-brand: ... } */
<div class="bg-brand">
```

